
constraint/
        Contains  xdc file (vcu118_ethernet.xdc) 
edn/
	processor_edn here.

toplevel/
	Contains the top level vhdl code of the SBC

hsys/
	We use this folder to construct our own core_library from highlevel to vhdl. It contains processor , Dram, Ethernet, serial and debug uarts
        Just do ./build.sh inside this folder (in the ajit-toolchain docker).

hsys_dram/
    Same as hsys but it contains only processor , DRAM , serial and debug Uarts.

verilog/
   Contains verilog files of some design units.

vhdl/
   Contains vhdl files of design units.

vivado_synth/
	Contains bitgen tcl file and run.sh script used to generate the bitfile and the working directory
	
ip/
	Contains the required ips.

TESTS/
        Contains Dram and Ethernet tests to verify the functionality. Ex : Marches test, Dram Profiler, Ping test, etc.
